          "speaker": "Assistant",
          "text": "La Mimosa is an expensive Mediterranean restaurant in the centre of town."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Learner",
          "text": "Could I have the address, phone number, and postcode, please?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Assistant",
          "text": "La Mimosa is at Thompsons Lane, Fen Ditton. The phone number is 01223 362525, and the postcode is CB5 8AQ."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Learner",
          "text": "That's all. Thank you. Goodbye."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Assistant",
          "text": "You're welcome. Goodbye."
        }
